# Jali's parameter sets are embedded byte for byte and pinned by SHA-256 (src/lattice/sets.rs):
# no end-of-line conversion on checkout (core.autocrlf would change the bytes, and Setup of the
# lattice instantiation would then refuse the files).
src/lattice/sets/*.json -text
# The vectors of the IETF CFRG drafts (kat/ietf/README.md) are the byte-for-byte output of
# tools/kat/ietf_vectors.py: no end-of-line conversion either.
kat/ietf/*.json -text
